<title>UK: ABB sets $150 mln convertible bond due 2004.</title>
<headline>ABB sets $150 mln convertible bond due 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON   **2.75-3.0  MATURITY   *     2004</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	IND PREM   20-24 PCT SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    **INDICATED, TO BE PRICED. *CALLALE AFTER YEAR THREE.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERTIBLE INTO EXISTING SHARES OF ABB AG</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
